    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the mysterious mechanics of manipulation, meticulously crafted through countless experiments to maximize the sensation of levitation.\u00a0This game is dedicated to those seeking a new gaming experience, embodying a deep and thoughtful exploration of what game controls can truly achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike its predecessor, Levitation Simulator 1, which required numerous physical control elements, Levitation Simulator 2 introduces an entirely new control mechanism. In this game, players must navigate their character using just a single key: the spacebar. Your journey to the destination relies solely on this one input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind this unique control system and make the most of extremely limited conditions. Place your fate in the spacebar as you transcend physical and timing-based controls to master all facets of your senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the mysterious mechanics of manipulation, meticulously crafted through countless experiments to maximize the sensation of levitation.\u00a0This game is dedicated to those seeking a new gaming experience, embodying a deep and thoughtful exploration of what game controls can truly achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike its predecessor, Levitation Simulator 1, which required numerous physical control elements, Levitation Simulator 2 introduces an entirely new control mechanism. In this game, players must navigate their character using just a single key: the spacebar. Your journey to the destination relies solely on this one input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind this unique control system and make the most of extremely limited conditions. Place your fate in the spacebar as you transcend physical and timing-based controls to master all facets of your senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
